{'symbol': 'EXPE', 'date': '2022-08-24 08:00:00', 'title': 'VACASA APPOINTS ROB GREYBER AS NEXT CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER', 'text': "PORTLAND, ORE.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VACASA (NASDAQ: VCSA), NORTH AMERICA'S LEADING VACATION RENTAL MANAGEMENT PLATFORM, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF ROB GREYBER AS CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER EFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 6. GREYBER JOINS VACASA WITH 20 YEARS OF EXPERIENCE BUILDING AND LEADING COMPANIES IN THE TRAVEL AND TECHNOLOGY INDUSTRIES. HE RECENTLY SERVED AS PRESIDENT OF EGENCIA, A CORPORATE TRAVEL BUSINESS PREVIOUSLY OWNED BY EXPEDIA GROUP (NASDAQ: EXPE), WHICH IS THE FOURTH LARGEST TRAVEL MANAGEM"}